+<h1>Returns and Refunds Policy</h1><p class="lede">How cancellations, returns and refunds work for our personalised gifts, other physical items and digital racecourse guides.</p></div></section>
+<article class="art"><div class="in">
+<h2 id="contact">Contact us</h2><p>ZANS Racing Tools &amp; Gifts, Leicester, England. [EMAIL ADDRESS NEEDED FROM ALEX]. Or <a href="https://www.etsy.com/uk/shop/ZANSRacingTools" target="_blank" rel="noopener">message us through our Etsy shop</a> (Message seller on the shop page or on your order). We aim to reply within 2 working days.</p>
+<h2>Summary</h2><ul><li><b>Personalised items</b> (silks mugs and baubles made with your colours, design code or names): no returns for a change of mind. A free replacement or full refund if the item arrives damaged, faulty, misprinted or not as described.</li><li><b>Other physical items</b> (not personalised): cancel within 14 days of receiving the item and send it back within 14 days of telling us. Refund within 14 days.</li><li><b>Digital PDF guides</b>: instant download, so the 14-day right to cancel ends once the file is available. If a file is faulty or not as described, we fix it, replace it or refund you.</li><li>Nothing in this policy affects your statutory rights under UK consumer law.</li></ul>
+<h2>1. Personalised items</h2><p>Our silks mugs and Christmas baubles are printed to order with the colours, design code and names you choose. Because they are made to your specification, the 14-day right to cancel under the Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013 does not apply, and we cannot accept returns for a change of mind or for a design or spelling you entered yourself. Please check your design and name before you order.</p><p>If your personalised item arrives damaged, faulty, misprinted or not as described, contact us within 30 days of delivery with your order number and a photo of the problem. We will send a free replacement or give you a full refund, including the original delivery charge. We will not ask you to post a damaged or misprinted item back.</p>
+<h2>2. Other physical items (not personalised)</h2><p><b>Right to cancel.</b> You can cancel for any reason from the day you order until 14 days after the day you receive the item. Tell us by message, or use the cancellation and return options on your Etsy order.</p><p><b>Sending it back.</b> Please return the item within 14 days after telling us, unused and in its original condition. Contact us first and we will give you the return address. You pay the return postage unless the item is faulty or not as described. We suggest a tracked service.</p><p><b>Your refund.</b> We refund the item price and the standard delivery charge you paid within 14 days of receiving the item back, or of you sending us proof of postage if sooner. We may reduce the refund if the item has been handled more than you would need to check it in a shop.</p><p><b>Faulty items.</b> Under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 you can reject a faulty item within 30 days of delivery for a full refund. After that you are entitled to a repair or replacement, and to a refund if that does not fix the problem.</p>
+<h2>3. Digital PDF guides</h2><p>Our racecourse guides are digital downloads: a zip file with colour and print PDFs. Nothing is posted. When you buy, you ask for instant access and agree that your 14-day right to cancel ends once the file is available to download.</p><p>If a file will not open, is incomplete or is not as described, contact us with your order number. We will send a working or corrected file, and if we cannot fix the problem we will refund you, as the Consumer Rights Act 2015 provides.</p>
+<h2>Return postage</h2><p>Personalised items that arrive damaged, faulty, misprinted or not as described: you do not need to send them back and pay nothing. Other physical items returned for a change of mind: you pay the return postage. Faulty or wrong items: we cover the cost.</p>
+<h2>Refunds</h2><p>All our orders are placed and paid for on Etsy, so refunds are made through Etsy to the payment method you used. We issue approved refunds within 14 days. Your bank or card provider may take a few more working days to show the money.</p>
+<h2>Your statutory rights</h2><p>This policy does not affect your statutory rights under UK consumer law, including the Consumer Rights Act 2015 and the Consumer Contracts (Information, Cancellation and Additional Charges) Regulations 2013. It sits alongside Etsy&#39;s own purchase protection and does not reduce it. Citizens Advice can give free advice on your rights.</p>
+<p><i>Last updated: 24 November 2026.</i></p>
